  "decision": "Selected the place coordinates of the Google Maps feature named 'Galaxy Backbone LTD', reached from the operator's own 'Google Map' link for its Kano office on its contact page (goo.gl/maps/3gTRqVE6BNqSUXVY7). The operator lists a single Kano address; it commissioned the 'National Tier IV data centre and North West Regional Office in Kano' together in February 2023, and its September 2024 release describes the Kano Tier IV Data Centre visit as a tour of Galaxy Backbone's key Kano facilities including the Network Operations Centre, conference room, training room and the Tier IV Data Centre. The point is therefore used as an inferred campus locator for the Kano data centre. Literal feature coordinate (the !3d/!4d place values, not the @ viewport centre), no geocoding or transformation.",
